      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert scriptwriter for a global financial news channel. Rewrite the following content into a professional 2-minute financial news broadcast script in Việt nam . The rewritten script must be in a single paragraph, without line breaks, special characters, URLs, or any commentary. Follow these requirements strictly: start with a strong hook, use a professional financial news tone, include key facts and data, make it engaging for viewers, and focus on financial implications and market impact. The target length is approximately 200 words. Content to rewrite output vietnamese: {{ $json.cleanedContent }}",
